#. type: Title =
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "ruby-build(1)"
msgstr "ruby-build(1)"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:3
msgid "Mislav Marohnić"
msgstr "Mislav Marohnić"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:11
msgid "ruby-build - Download, compile, and install a version of Ruby"
msgstr "ruby-build - Rubyのバージョンをダウンロード、コンパイル、インストール"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr "処方"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ruby-build [-dvpk] _<definition>_ _<prefix>_ [-- _<configure-args>_...]\n"
"ruby-build {--list|--definitions}\n"
"ruby-build --resolve _<version>_\n"
"ruby-build --version"
msgstr ""
"ruby-build [-dvpk] _＜定義＞_ _＜接頭辞＞_ [-- _＜構成引数＞_...]\n"
"ruby-build {--list|--definitions}\n"
"ruby-build --resolve _＜版＞_\n"
"ruby-build --version"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Description"
msgstr "説明"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:23
msgid ""
"ruby-build downloads, compiles, and installs a Ruby version named by the "
"_definition_ argument into the location specified by _prefix_."
msgstr ""
"ruby-buildは、 _定義_ 引数の名前のバージョンのRubyを、 _プレフィックス_ で指"
"定された場所へ、ダウンロード、コンパイル、インストールします。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:26
msgid ""
"The _definition_ argument can be a path to a file on disk, in which case it "
"is sourced into ruby-build as a bash script."
msgstr ""
"_定義_ 引数はディスク上のファイルへのパスにできます。\n"
"この場合、bashスクリプトとしてruby-buildにソースが読み込まれます。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Optionally, extra Ruby _configure-args_ may be listed after \"--\" and will "
"get forwarded to the `./configure` invocation."
msgstr ""
"また、追加でRubyの _構成引数_ を「--」の後に列挙できます。\n"
"このようにすると、 `./configure` の呼出しへ転送されます。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:33
msgid ""
"By default, all compile output is redirected to a log file at `$TMPDIR/ruby-"
"build.*.log`. Activate the verbose mode to skip the log file and print "
"everything to standard streams."
msgstr ""
"既定では、全てのコンパイル出力は `$TMPDIR/ruby-build.*.log` にあるログファイ"
"ルにリダイレクトされます。\n"
"冗長モードを有効にするとログファイルへの書き込みはスキップし、全て標準スト"
"リームに印字します。"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:34 ../README.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ruby versions"
msgstr "Rubyの版"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:41
msgid ""
"When listing \"latest\" Ruby versions, such as in `--list` output, ruby-"
"build only knows of Ruby versions that are bundled with this project.  That "
"means that when a new Ruby version comes out, ruby-build will not know about "
"it immediately; you will have to upgrade ruby-build before you can use it to "
"install the new Ruby version."
msgstr ""
"`--list`の出力のように、「最新の」Rubyの版を一覧するとき、ruby-buildはこのプロジェクトに付属するRubyの版しか知りません。\n"
"つまり新しいRubyの版が出たとき、ruby-buildは直ちにはそれについて知らないでしょう。\n"
"その新しいRubyの版をインストールするためにはruby-buildを更新しなければ使えません。"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:42 ../README.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ruby implementations"
msgstr "Rubyの実装"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:45
msgid ""
"ruby-build ships with definitions for the following Ruby implementations:"
msgstr "ruby-buildは以下のRubyの実装について定義を備えています。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:48
msgid ""
"CRuby, also known as \"MRI\": denoted by version numbers in form of "
"\"X.Y.Z\".  This is the main Ruby implementation that most people use."
msgstr ""
"CRuby、または「MRI」としても知られるもの：「X.Y.Z」の形式の版番号で記されます。\n"
"これはほとんどの人々が使う主要なRubyの実装です。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:51
msgid ""
"\"jruby\": High-performance Ruby implementation with real threading built on "
"top of the Java virtual machine (JVM)."
msgstr "\"jruby\"：高性能なRubyの実装で、Java仮想マシン (Java Virtual Machine; JVM) を土台に本物のスレッドが付いています。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:53
msgid "\"mruby\": Lightweight Ruby for microcontrollers."
msgstr "\"mruby\"：マイクロコントローラ用の軽量Ruby。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:55
msgid ""
"\"picoruby\": Alternative mruby implementation for one-chip microcontrollers."
msgstr "\"picoruby\"：1チップマイクロコントローラ用の代替のmruby実装。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:58
msgid ""
"\"truffleruby\": The Native standalone distribution of TruffleRuby, an "
"implementation of Ruby on top of GraalVM's Truffle framework."
msgstr "\"truffleruby\"：ネイティブの独立したTruffleRubyの頒布物で、GraalVMのTruffleフレームワークを土台にしたRubyの実装。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:60
msgid ""
"\"truffleruby+graalvm\": The JVM standalone distribution of TruffleRuby."
msgstr "\"truffleruby+graalvm\"：TruffleRubyのJVMの独立した頒布物。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:66
msgid ""
"The _definition_ argument may optionally start with \"ruby-\", in which case "
"it resolves to a CRuby that matches the version number that follows. The "
"_definition_ argument may also be a name of one of the alternative Ruby "
"implementations, in which case the latest version of that implementation "
"will be installed."
msgstr ""
"_定義_ 引数は随意で「ruby-」から始めても構わず、その場合は後に続く版番号に合致するCRubyに解決されます。\n"
"_定義_ 引数は代替のRubyの実装のいずれかの名前にしても構わず、その場合その実装の最新版がインストールされます。"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options"
msgstr "オプション"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-l, --list*"
msgstr "*-l, --list*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:71
msgid "List latest stable releases for each Ruby"
msgstr "Rubyの最新の安定リリースが、各行に一覧で表示されます"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "*--definitions*"
msgstr "*--definitions*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:74
msgid "List all local definitions, including outdated ones"
msgstr ""
"全てのローカルの定義を一覧にします。\n"
"期限切れのものも含まれます。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "*--resolve*"
msgstr "*--resolve*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:77
msgid ""
"Print the definition name of the latest stable Ruby version matching the "
"_version_ argument"
msgstr "_版_ 引数に合致する最新安定なRubyの版の定義名を印字"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "*--version*"
msgstr "*--version*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:80
msgid "Show version of ruby-build"
msgstr "ruby-buildのバージョンを表示します"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-d, --dir*"
msgstr "*-d, --dir*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:83
msgid ""
"Install the Ruby in the _prefix/definition_ destination instead of directly "
"in _prefix_"
msgstr ""
"_プレフィックス_ に直接インストールするのではなく、 _プレフィックス/定義_ に"
"Rubyをインストールするようにします。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-v, --verbose*"
msgstr "*-v, --verbose*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:86
msgid "Verbose mode: forward all build output to stdout/stderr"
msgstr ""
"冗長モードです。\n"
"ビルド時の出力を標準入力と標準エラーに転送します"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-p, --patch*"
msgstr "*-p, --patch*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:89
msgid "Apply a patch from stdin before building"
msgstr "ビルド前に標準入力からパッチを適用します"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-k, --keep*"
msgstr "*-k, --keep*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:92
msgid "Do not remove source tree after installation"
msgstr "インストール後にソースツリーを削除しません"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-4, --ipv4*"
msgstr "*-4, --ipv4*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:95
msgid "Resolve names to IPv4 addresses only"
msgstr "IPv4アドレスのみに名前解決します"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-6, --ipv6*"
msgstr "*-6, --ipv6*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:98
msgid "Resolve names to IPv6 addresses only"
msgstr "IPv6アドレスのみに名前解決します"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "例"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:102
msgid "Install a Ruby version while tweaking some configuration options:"
msgstr ""
"Rubyのバージョンをインストールします。\n"
"ただし構成オプションを調整します。"

#. type: delimited block -
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "$ ruby-build 3.4.9 /path/to/destination -- --disable-install-doc --with-openssl-dir=/opt/openssl\n"
msgstr "$ ruby-build 3.4.9 /path/to/destination -- --disable-install-doc --with-openssl-dir=/opt/openssl\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:107
msgid "Install a Ruby version to `~/.rubies/ruby-3.4.9`:"
msgstr "Rubyのバージョンを`~/.rubies/ruby-3.4.9`にインストールします。"

#. type: delimited block -
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "$ ruby-build --dir ruby-3.4.9 ~/.rubies\n"
msgstr "$ ruby-build --dir ruby-3.4.9 ~/.rubies\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:112
msgid "Install the latest Ruby 3.x version to `~/.rubies/ruby-3.x.y`:"
msgstr "最新のRuby 3.x版を`~/.rubies/ruby-3.x.y`へインストール："

#. type: delimited block -
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "$ ruby-build --dir ruby-3 ~/.rubies\n"
msgstr "$ ruby-build --dir ruby-3 ~/.rubies\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:117
msgid "Install a Ruby version to `~/.rbenv/versions/3.3.11`:"
msgstr "Rubyのバージョンを`~/.rbenv/versions/3.3.11`へインストール："

#. type: delimited block -
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "$ ruby-build --dir 3.3.11 ~/.rbenv/versions\n"
msgstr "$ ruby-build --dir 3.3.11 ~/.rbenv/versions\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:122
msgid "Usage as rbenv plugin, accomplishes the same as the previous example:"
msgstr ""
"rbenvプラグインとしての使い方は次の通りです。\n"
"前の例と同じことが達成されます。"

#. type: delimited block -
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:124
#, no-wrap
msgid "$ rbenv install 3.3.11\n"
msgstr "$ rbenv install 3.3.11\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "Environment Variables"
msgstr "環境変数"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "*TMPDIR*"
msgstr "*TMPDIR*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:130
msgid "The location to write temporary files on disk"
msgstr "ディスク上の一時ファイルに書き込む場所"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_BUILD_PATH* (default: a timestamped subdirectory of _TMPDIR_)"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_BUILD_PATH*（既定では _TMPDIR_ の時間記録付きの副ディレクトリです）"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:133
msgid "The build location for downloading source files to and compiling"
msgstr "ソースファイルをダウンロードしてコンパイルする、ビルド場所です"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:134
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_CACHE_PATH* (default: \"~/.rbenv/cache\" if invoked as rbenv plugin)"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_CACHE_PATH*（rbenvプラグインとして呼ばれたとき、既定では「~/.rbenv/cache」です）"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:136
msgid "Where to cache downloaded package files"
msgstr "ダウンロードしたパッケージファイルをキャッシュする場所です"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_HTTP_CLIENT* (default: first tool found in PATH)"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_HTTP_CLIENT*（既定ではPATHから見つかった最初のツールです）"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:139
msgid "One of \"aria2c\", \"curl\", or \"wget\" to use for downloading"
msgstr "ダウンロードに使うもので、「aria2c」「curl」「wget」のいずれかです"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:140
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_ARIA2_OPTS*"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_ARIA2_OPTS*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:142
msgid "Additional options to pass to aria2c for downloading"
msgstr "ダウンロード時にaria2cに渡す追加のオプションです"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_CURL_OPTS*"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_CURL_OPTS*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:145
msgid "Additional options to pass to curl for downloading"
msgstr "ダウンロード時にcurlに渡す追加のオプションです"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_WGET_OPTS*"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_WGET_OPTS*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:148
msgid "Additional options to pass to wget for downloading"
msgstr "ダウンロードでwgetに渡す追加のオプションです"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:149
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_MIRROR_URL* (default: a sponsored Amazon CloudFront mirror)"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_MIRROR_URL*（既定では、スポンサーのAmazon CloudFrontのミラーです）"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:151
msgid "Custom mirror URL root to download packages from"
msgstr "パッケージをダウンロードする、独自のミラーURLのルートです"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:152
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_MIRROR_PACKAGE_URL*"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_MIRROR_PACKAGE_URL*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:154
msgid "Custom complete mirror URL"
msgstr "独自の完全なミラーURLです"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:155
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_SKIP_MIRROR*"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_SKIP_MIRROR*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:157
msgid ""
"Bypass the download mirror and fetch all package files from their original "
"URLs"
msgstr ""
"ダウンロードミラーを迂回し、元々のURLから全てのパッケージファイルを取得します"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:158
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_ROOT* (default: \"share/ruby-build\" within ruby-build install location)"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_ROOT*（既定では、ruby-buildのインストール場所内の「share/ruby-build」です）"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:160
msgid "Custom build definition directory"
msgstr "独自のビルド定義ディレクトリです"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_TARBALL_OVERRIDE*"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_TARBALL_OVERRIDE*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:163
msgid ""
"Override the URL to fetch the ruby tarball from, optionally followed by "
"\"#<checksum>\""
msgstr ""
"Rubyのtarballを取得するURLを上塗りします。\n"
"「#<checksum>」を後ろに付けることもできます"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:164
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_BUILD_DEFINITIONS*"
msgstr "*RUBY_BUILD_DEFINITIONS*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:166
msgid "Paths to search for build definitions in addition to _RUBY_BUILD_ROOT_"
msgstr "_RUBY_BUILD_ROOT_ に加えて、ビルド定義を探索するパスです"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:167
#, no-wrap
msgid "*CC*"
msgstr "*CC*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:169
msgid "Path to the C compiler"
msgstr "Cコンパイラへのパスです"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:170
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_CFLAGS*"
msgstr "*RUBY_CFLAGS*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:172
msgid "Additional `CFLAGS` options to use for Ruby compilation"
msgstr "Rubyのコンパイルに使う追加の `CFLAGS` オプションです"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:173
#, no-wrap
msgid "*CONFIGURE_OPTS*"
msgstr "*CONFIGURE_OPTS*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:175
msgid "Additional \"./configure\" arguments"
msgstr "「./configure」の追加引数です"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:176
#, no-wrap
msgid "*MAKE* (default: \"make\")"
msgstr "*MAKE*（既定では「make」です）"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:178
msgid "Custom make command (e.g., \"gmake\")"
msgstr "独自のmakeコマンドです（例えば「gmake」）"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:179
#, no-wrap
msgid "*MAKE_OPTS*, *MAKEOPTS*"
msgstr "*MAKE_OPTS*, *MAKEOPTS*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:181
msgid "Additional arguments for \"make\""
msgstr "「make」への追加の引数です"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:182
#, no-wrap
msgid "*MAKE_INSTALL_OPTS*"
msgstr "*MAKE_INSTALL_OPTS*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:184
msgid "Additional arguments for \"make install\""
msgstr "「make install」への追加の引数です"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:185
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_CONFIGURE_OPTS*"
msgstr "*RUBY_CONFIGURE_OPTS*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:187
msgid "Additional \"./configure\" arguments that apply only to Ruby source"
msgstr "「./configure」への追加の引数で、Rubyのソースにのみ適用されます"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:188
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_MAKE_OPTS*"
msgstr "*RUBY_MAKE_OPTS*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:190
msgid "Additional make arguments that apply only to Ruby source"
msgstr "makeへの追加の引数で、Rubyのソースにのみ適用されます"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "*RUBY_MAKE_INSTALL_OPTS*"
msgstr "*RUBY_MAKE_INSTALL_OPTS*"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:193
msgid "Additional \"make install\" arguments that apply only to Ruby source"
msgstr "「make install」への追加の引数で、Rubyのソースにのみ適用されます"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../share/man/man1/ruby-build.1.adoc:194
#, no-wrap
msgid "*NO_COLOR* (default: allow colors when connected to terminal)"
